 "name": "Template · Burger joint: counter board, 55\" landscape, turns to portrait (DP-14)",
 "notes": "WayTuGo's burger-joint template: an invented downtown keto burger bar, The Meet Market (prices typical of the Birmingham area in 2026). Looks: Dark (the default) and Light, which the shop can choose or set by the time of day in the menu editor's Board look. It turns: the portrait arrangement is used when the screen's Orientation is portrait. In the WayTuGo Templates account: upload the pictures first (Pictures tab, named as in layouts/template-burger-pictures.md), paste this on the Design tab and Check, then on the Menu tab Make lists from this layout (burgers room 9, off the bun 6, starters & sides 9, shakes & drinks 5), Preview and Publish. The 32\" portrait board (template-burger-32.json) goes on the same menu.",
